WEBVTT

00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:12.064
HELEN: What are we gonna do?

00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:13.664
BOB: I don't know.

00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:15.424
Maybe Dicker
will find something?

00:00:15.584 --> 00:00:16.904
Dicker is done, Bob.

00:00:17.064 --> 00:00:20.144
Any thought we had about being
Supers again is fantasy.

00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:21.864
One of us has gotta get a job.

00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:23.144
One of us?

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:25.264
You did a long stint
at Insuricare.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.024
Hated every minute of it.

00:00:27.184 --> 00:00:28.864
I know it was hard on you.

00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:30.704
Maybe it's my turn
in the private sector

00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:31.784
and you take care
of the kids...

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:34.904
No, I'm doing this.
I need to do this.

00:00:35.984 --> 00:00:37.784
You know
where my suit and ties are?

00:00:37.944 --> 00:00:38.944
Burned up when...

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:41.024
BOTH:
The jet destroyed our house.

00:00:41.224 --> 00:00:42.584
(CHUCKLES) Yeah.

00:00:42.784 --> 00:00:45.184
We can't count
on anyone else now, Bob.

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:46.504
It's just us.

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:47.784
-We can't wait for...
-(DOOR BANGS)

00:00:56.664 --> 00:00:58.704
LUCIUS: No lifeguard on duty!

00:00:58.864 --> 00:01:00.304
Swim at your own risk.

00:01:00.464 --> 00:01:01.864
Oh, where'd you go today?

00:01:02.024 --> 00:01:04.104
I noticed
you missed all the fun.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.824
LUCIUS: Don't be mad because
I know when to leave a party.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.344
I'm just as illegal
as you guys.

00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:11.064
Besides, I knew the cops
would let you go.

00:01:11.224 --> 00:01:12.744
Yeah, in spite
of Bob's best efforts.

00:01:12.904 --> 00:01:14.424
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:14.584 --> 00:01:17.184
I heard the program shut down.

00:01:17.384 --> 00:01:19.064
How much longer
are you in this motel?

00:01:19.264 --> 00:01:20.384
Two weeks.

00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:22.144
Now, you know
the offer still stands.

00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:24.544
You're very generous,
but there are five of us.

00:01:24.704 --> 00:01:26.264
We wouldn't do that
to you and Honey.

00:01:26.424 --> 00:01:27.864
Well, door's always open.

00:01:28.064 --> 00:01:30.184
You know,
the news isn't all bad.

00:01:30.344 --> 00:01:33.024
While you guys
were being detained...

00:01:33.184 --> 00:01:36.784
I was approached by a dude
who represents this tycoon.

00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:38.904
BOB: Winston Deavor.
LUCIUS: Wants to talk...

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:42.224
with me, with you two,
about hero stuff.

00:01:42.584 --> 00:01:43.584
LUCIUS: I checked him out.

00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:44.824
He's legit.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.544
Trained under Dicker.
He wants to meet.

00:01:46.704 --> 00:01:48.744
Ah, jeez!
More superhero trouble.

00:01:48.904 --> 00:01:50.784
We just came from the
police station, Lucius.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.744
-When?
-Tonight. I'm going there now.

00:01:54.744 --> 00:01:56.384
You enjoy,
I'm sitting this one out.

00:01:56.544 --> 00:01:58.024
He wants all three of us.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.704
Honey, let's just at least
hear what he has to say.

00:02:01.864 --> 00:02:04.344
You got the address,
I'll meet you guys there.

00:02:04.504 --> 00:02:06.504
Go in our Supersuits?

00:02:06.664 --> 00:02:07.944
Yeah.

00:02:08.344 --> 00:02:10.584
Might wanna wear
the old Supersuits.

00:02:10.744 --> 00:02:13.584
Got a feeling he's nostalgic.

00:02:17.184 --> 00:02:19.104
Where are you going?

00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:21.584
The fresh air
is especially good tonight.

00:02:21.744 --> 00:02:22.784
If Jack-Jack wakes up...

00:02:22.944 --> 00:02:24.504
I know the drill.

00:02:27.104 --> 00:02:28.304
(DOOR CLOSES)

00:02:34.384 --> 00:02:37.944
Your security badges.
Please, this way.

00:02:38.104 --> 00:02:39.424
Hey, listen,
you're my biggest fan.

00:02:39.584 --> 00:02:40.584
-Good to see you.
-(STAMMERING)

00:02:40.744 --> 00:02:43.464
I'm your biggest fan.
Shoot!

00:02:57.664 --> 00:02:58.864
(ELEVATOR BELL DINGS)

00:03:06.824 --> 00:03:10.064
WINSTON: I love superheroes!

00:03:10.224 --> 00:03:12.344
The powers, the costumes...

00:03:12.544 --> 00:03:14.064
the mythic struggles.

00:03:14.224 --> 00:03:16.224
Winston Deavor.
You can call me Win.

00:03:16.384 --> 00:03:17.624
Genuine pleasure to meet you.

00:03:17.784 --> 00:03:19.344
-Frozone!
-It's good to see you.

00:03:19.504 --> 00:03:20.864
-Elastigirl.
-Nice to meet you.

00:03:21.024 --> 00:03:22.864
-Mr. Incredible!
-Hello.

00:03:23.024 --> 00:03:25.784
♪ Mr. Incredible, Incredible

00:03:25.944 --> 00:03:27.104
BOTH:
♪ Incredible

00:03:27.304 --> 00:03:30.304
♪ Catching the bad guys
Pow, pow, pow ♪

00:03:30.384 --> 00:03:31.504
(BOTH LAUGH)

00:03:31.584 --> 00:03:33.784
♪ Who's the cat
Who's always chill

00:03:33.984 --> 00:03:37.344
♪ When survival odds
Are close to nil

00:03:37.504 --> 00:03:40.544
♪ Frozone
Frozone

00:03:41.184 --> 00:03:42.864
BOTH:
♪ Frozone ♪

00:03:43.024 --> 00:03:44.264
-Yeah!
-(ALL LAUGH)

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:46.944
Can't tell you what a thrill
this is. And this...

00:03:47.104 --> 00:03:50.904
Oh, hello there, superheroes.
I'm so sorry I'm late.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.984
...is my tardy sister, Evelyn.

00:03:53.144 --> 00:03:56.464
And I'm scolding myself
so you don't have to, Winston!

00:03:56.824 --> 00:03:57.824
Spectacular.

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:00.384
My father was so proud

00:04:00.464 --> 00:04:03.504
that I was even remotely
connected to you guys.

00:04:03.664 --> 00:04:05.824
He used to call you
the last line of defense.

00:04:05.984 --> 00:04:07.744
He was your top supporter.

00:04:07.904 --> 00:04:10.144
He donated
to superhero causes.

00:04:10.344 --> 00:04:11.664
He raised money

00:04:11.744 --> 00:04:13.464
for the Dynaguy statue
in Avery Park.

00:04:13.624 --> 00:04:15.464
He got to know
many Supers personally.

00:04:15.624 --> 00:04:17.304
Even installed a phone

00:04:17.384 --> 00:04:20.264
with direct lines
to Gazerbeam and Fironic...

00:04:20.424 --> 00:04:21.904
in case of emergencies.

00:04:22.064 --> 00:04:24.464
He loved that,
showed it off to everyone.

00:04:24.624 --> 00:04:25.864
He was heartbroken

00:04:25.944 --> 00:04:27.384
when you were all forced
to go underground.

00:04:27.544 --> 00:04:29.144
Father believed the world

00:04:29.224 --> 00:04:30.984
would become more dangerous
without you.

00:04:32.344 --> 00:04:34.304
He didn't know
how right he was.

00:04:35.344 --> 00:04:36.784
There was a break-in.

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:38.704
(BOTH GASP)

00:04:38.784 --> 00:04:41.024
WINSTON:
My father called Gazerbeam.

00:04:41.104 --> 00:04:42.664
The direct line.

00:04:42.784 --> 00:04:44.224
-(LINE BEEPS)
-No answer.

00:04:44.424 --> 00:04:47.264
He called Fironic, no answer.

00:04:47.424 --> 00:04:49.664
Superheroes had just been
made illegal...

00:04:50.584 --> 00:04:52.504
The robbers discovered him
on the phone...

00:04:52.664 --> 00:04:53.984
-and shot him.
-(GUNSHOT)

00:04:55.664 --> 00:04:57.104
So...

00:04:58.104 --> 00:04:59.104
ELASTIGIRL:
It must've been hard.

00:04:59.264 --> 00:05:00.704
EVELYN: Especially for Mother.

00:05:00.864 --> 00:05:03.984
She died a few months later.
Heartbreak.

00:05:04.144 --> 00:05:06.784
If superheroes had not been
forced underground...

00:05:06.944 --> 00:05:08.144
it never would've happened.

00:05:08.304 --> 00:05:10.624
Or Dad could've taken Mom
to the safe room

00:05:10.744 --> 00:05:11.824
as soon as he knew
there was trouble.

00:05:11.984 --> 00:05:13.424
I disagree strongly!

00:05:13.504 --> 00:05:15.464
But we're not going
into it right now.

00:05:16.544 --> 00:05:17.584
The point is...

00:05:17.744 --> 00:05:19.504
nobody expected us

00:05:19.584 --> 00:05:22.064
to be able to actually run
Dad's company.

00:05:22.224 --> 00:05:25.664
But with Evelyn as designer,
and myself as operator...

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:28.224
uh, we threw ourselves
into building DEVTECH

00:05:28.344 --> 00:05:29.824
into what it is today.

00:05:29.984 --> 00:05:32.464
FROZONE: A world-class
telecommunications company.

00:05:32.624 --> 00:05:33.784
Bigger than ever.

00:05:33.944 --> 00:05:37.024
Perfectly positioned to make
some wrong things right.

00:05:37.184 --> 00:05:38.904
Hence, this meeting.

00:05:39.104 --> 00:05:40.504
Let me ask you something.

00:05:40.664 --> 00:05:42.304
What is the main reason

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:44.104
you were all
forced underground?

00:05:44.264 --> 00:05:46.224
-Ignorance.
-Perception.

00:05:46.384 --> 00:05:48.464
Take today for example,
with the Underminer.

00:05:48.624 --> 00:05:49.744
Difficult situation.

00:05:49.944 --> 00:05:52.224
You were faced
with a lot of hard decisions.

00:05:52.384 --> 00:05:53.464
Oh, tell me about it.

00:05:53.664 --> 00:05:54.864
WINSTON: I can't.

00:05:55.024 --> 00:05:57.344
Because I didn't see it...

00:05:57.504 --> 00:05:59.264
neither did anyone else.

00:05:59.424 --> 00:06:01.624
So, when you fight bad guys
like today...

00:06:01.784 --> 00:06:04.384
people don't see the fight
or what led up to it.

00:06:04.544 --> 00:06:06.704
They see what politicians
tell them to see.

00:06:06.864 --> 00:06:09.464
They see destruction
and they see you.

00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:11.304
So, if we wanna change

00:06:11.384 --> 00:06:13.624
people's perceptions
about superheroes...

00:06:13.784 --> 00:06:14.984
we need you

00:06:15.104 --> 00:06:17.424
to share your perceptions
with the world.

00:06:17.584 --> 00:06:19.464
-How do we do that?
-EVELYN: With cameras.

00:06:19.624 --> 00:06:23.544
We need you to share your
perceptions with the world.

00:06:23.704 --> 00:06:24.864
ELASTIGIRL: How do we do that?

00:06:25.064 --> 00:06:27.064
EVELYN: We embed tiny cameras,
like those,

00:06:27.144 --> 00:06:28.344
into your Supersuits.

00:06:28.504 --> 00:06:29.624
Wow, so small.

00:06:29.824 --> 00:06:31.184
And the picture
is outstanding.

00:06:31.344 --> 00:06:32.784
Thanks! Designed 'em myself.

00:06:33.224 --> 00:06:34.504
WINSTON: We've got resources,
lobbyists,

00:06:34.584 --> 00:06:35.944
worldwide connections...

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:38.264
and very important, insurance.

00:06:38.424 --> 00:06:39.664
Insurance is key.

00:06:39.824 --> 00:06:42.104
All we need now
are the super-est superheroes.

00:06:42.264 --> 00:06:44.544
It needs you three.
Come on!

00:06:44.704 --> 00:06:47.744
Help me make all Supers
legal again.

00:06:48.024 --> 00:06:49.384
This sounds great!

00:06:49.544 --> 00:06:51.464
Let's get this going.
What's my first assignment?

00:06:51.624 --> 00:06:53.624
That enthusiasm is golden.
(CHUCKLING)

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:55.944
Now hold on to it.
But for our first move...

00:06:56.144 --> 00:06:58.944
Well, Elastigirl
is our best play.

